OL,3,GSouth West
OL,4,
OL,5,CToday:FAfter a cold and frosty start
OL,6,Ffor many there will be plenty of dry
OL,7,Fand bright weather around on Saturday.
OL,8,FPerhaps more cloud for a time in the
OL,9,Ffar west though, giving the odd light
OL,10,Fshower. A southerly breeze developing.
OL,11,
OL,12,CTonight:FClear spells this evening,
OL,13,Fbut cloud thickening from the west
OL,14,Fovernight, bringing scattered showers.
OL,15,FThough temperatures will be higher
OL,16,Fthan previous nights, a touch of rural
OL,17,Ffrost is still likely.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
OL,24,ANext Page  BWeather  CReg News  FReg TV
