OL,2,W+.-'"-$/*%*%*%/"-$/*%Q,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,3,GSouth West
OL,4,
OL,5,CSunday:FSome bright spells on Sunday,
OL,6,Fbut also rain and showers which may be
OL,7,Fheavy, thundery, and frequent at
OL,8,Ftimes. Feeling chilly and unpleasant
OL,9,Fin the wet and often breezy conditions.
OL,10,
OL,11,COutlook for Monday to Wednesday:FSome
OL,12,Fearly brightness on Monday morning,
OL,13,Fthough wet and windy weather moving
OL,14,Fnortheast through the day. Brighter
OL,15,Fbut with blustery showers on Tuesday,
OL,16,Fand remaining very showery on
OL,17,FWednesday.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
